# Compact liquid-water cloud grid for the radius-integration comparison
# (validation/radius_grid/compact_lut_radius.py).  Not a production grid.
5 uneven_logarithmic # optical depth
0.5 2.0 8.0 32.0 128.0
8 uneven_linear # physical effective radius, microns
1.0 2.0 3.0 5.0 10.0 20.0 30.0 40.0
3 uneven_linear # solar zenith, degrees
0.0 30.0 60.0
3 uneven_linear # satellite zenith, degrees
0.0 30.0 55.0
3 linear # relative azimuth, degrees, 0-180
0 180
